You're confusing statues and figurines.  

Figurines can be applied to create whatever monster they are of
(ie, apply figurine of gray dragon, a gray dragon appears).  If blessed
they are tame, if uncursed they are peaceful, if cursed they are pissed
off.

Statues are usually too heavy to carry, but i hear that sometimes 
you might want to hit them with a pickaxe.  Occasionally what appears
to be a statue is a monster posing as a statue, but you'll know them when
you see them.  

